DESCRIPTION:Submitted by the Event OrganizerFive startup founders take the
  stage in San Francisco for five-minute pitches\, live audience questions\
 , and a night of focused startup networking.\nBefore the pitch session\, a
 ttendees join themed networking tables based on topics selected by the roo
 m. Instead of wandering around looking for someone to talk to\, participan
 ts connect around shared startup challenges such as fundraising\, product\
 , go-to-market\, hiring\, pricing\, and growth.\nThen five selected founde
 rs present what they are building. Each founder gets five minutes\, follow
 ed by questions and feedback from the audience.\nAfter the pitches\, the e
 vening opens into relaxed networking with founders\, engineers\, operators
 \, investors\, and other members of the Bay Area startup community.\nThe e
 vent is designed for startup founders\, technical builders\, operators\, p
 roduct professionals\, entrepreneurs\, and people interested in early-stag
 e companies and technology.\n\n$12.60\n\nTickets: https://www.eventbrite.c
 om/e/startup-pitch-events-san-francisco-5-founders-on-stage-tickets-199953
 3239746?aff=oddtdtcreator&amp\;utm_source=eventbrite&amp\;utm_medium=organ
 ic&amp\;utm_campaign=startup-pitch-events-san-francisco-5-founders-on-stag
 e\nDetails: https://sf.funcheap.com/startup-pitch-events-san-francisco-5-f
 ounders-stage/\nSource: Funcheap SF
