DESCRIPTION:The San Francisco Fall Cider Fest: Camp SPARK Edition\nSaturda
 y\, November 7 | SPARK Social SF\n\nAutumn is calling… and this year\, w
 e’re heading back to CAMP SPARK!\n\nSAN FRANCISCO FALL CIDER FEST 2026: 
 CAMP SPARK EDITION\n\nGet ready for the ultimate fall escape at San Franci
 sco Fall Cider Fest: Camp SPARK Edition! Join us at SPARK Social SF on Sat
 urday\, November 7\, for an afternoon of craft cider\, delicious food\, an
 d cozy camp vibes.\n\nDiscover more than 30 craft ciders\, grab a bite fro
 m 15+ food trucks\, and settle in by the fire pits for s’mores and live 
 music. Enjoy camp-inspired games\, friendly competitions\, picture-perfect
  photo ops\, and a pumpkin pie eating contest for the ultimate fall celebr
 ation. Gather your friends and get ready to sip\, snack\, and make some me
 mories!\n\nWELCOME TO CAMP SPARK\nSip your way through unlimited pours of 
 incredible ciders while taking on camp games\, ridiculous challenges\, col
 lectible badges\, and just the right amount of mischief. Come thirsty\, br
 ing your crew\, and find your new favorite cider along the way.\n\nNo cabi
 ns. No curfew. Just unlimited cider\, camp chaos\, and absolutely no matur
 ity required.\n\nFeaturing:\n\n30+ craft ciders to discover and taste\; si
 p everything from crisp classics to new\, unexpected flavors\n15+ food tru
 cks serving up delicious eats\nFire pits\, s’mores\, and cozy camp vibes
 \nLive music to soundtrack your ultimate fall escape\nCamp games\, activit
 ies\, and competitions where bragging rights are on the line\nPicture-perf
 ect CAMP SPARK...\n\n$30-$60\, 21+\nCamp SPARK Edition\n\nDetails: https:/
 /dothebay.com/events/2026/11/7/the-san-francisco-fall-cider-fest-2026-tick
 ets\nSource: DoTheBay\n\nAlso listed on:\n- https://sf.funcheap.com/2026-s
 an-francisco-fall-cider-fest-unlimited-tastings-of-30-ciders/
