 ks + Live Music (Dec. 5-6)\nSunset Mercantile\nCome Eat\, Drink\, Shop\, P
 lay\, Connect\, and Be Local at the 11th Annual Sunset Holiday Mercantile 
 at the County Fair Building in Golden Gate Park!\nSunset Holiday Mercantil
 e in 2026 which features TWO DAYS of artisan makers and vendors\, plus liv
 e music\, food\, activities and more. Admission is free! Come to the Count
 y Fair Building in Golden Gate Park\, December 5th and 6th from 11 AM to 5
  PM to join the fun.\nEnjoy:\n100+ Local Makers\, Merchants\, Artists and 
 Vendors\nFood Artisans and Food Trucks\nHoliday themed photo booth\nChildr
 en + Family Activities\nLive Music\nStorytelling\nCommunity Causes\nBeer +
  Wine Tasting\nFree admission\nWhile in the neighborhood\, be sure to expl
 ore all the unique shops and eateries of the Inner Sunset!\nEat\, Drink\, 
 Shop\, Play\, Connect\, and Be Local with Sunset Mercantile.\n\nSATURDAY\,
  DEC. 5 + SUNDAY DEC. 6\n11 am-5 pm\nSan Francisco County Fair Building\nG
