DESCRIPTION:Steve Rhodes via Flickr - CC BY-NC-ND 2.0“SantaCon” is San
  Francisco’s annual city-wide Santas-only pub crawl happening on Saturda
 y\, December 12\, 2026*.\nSantaCon Comedy Show! Funcheap is hosting our se
 cond ever SantaCon Comedy Crawl at The Function 1414 Market St. @ Polk ope
 ning at 6p with winter cocktail\, and a Santa + Elves comedy show at 7P + 
 9P! RSVP for Free tickets\n\nAll full-on Santas will get all-night happy h
 our pricing on the holiday cocktail menu – just ask at the bar when orde
 ring!\n\nThis flash mob-type event brings together hundreds of slightly so
 ber people dressed in Santa costumes parading around the city\, visiting l
 andmarks drinking at bars\, and causing general mayhem.\n\nSponsored: If y
 ou’d prefer something a little more coordinated – with guaranteed bar 
 access\, wristband enry\, and a clear crawl route –this ticketed SantaCo
 n-style pub crawl in the Mission and Downtown is a great alternative!\nAnd
  just so you know\, wearing a Santa hat isn’t enough… get yourself a f
 ull-on Santa suit.\nSantaCon 2026\nSaturday\, December 12\, 2026 | Noon to
  about 7pm*\n*TENTATIVE FOR 2026 – “OFFICIAL” INFO NOT YET RELEASED 
 FOR 2026 – IT’S A SEMI-ORGANIZED\, UNOFFICIAL EVENT\nMeet at Union Squ
 are Park\, San Francisco\nFREE – Rain or Shine – if you see people sel
 ling tickets to SantaCon\, please note it is not affiliated with the origi
 nal SantaCon in any way – Instead\, bring a toy to donate.\n2025 Map + S
 chedule – Coming Soon!\n\nBring a new unwrapped toy to donate to the SF 
 Fire Dept. Toy Drive – b...\n\nFree\n\nTickets: https://www.instagram.co
 m/officialsantaconsf\nDetails: https://sf.funcheap.com/santacon-san-franci
 sco/\nSource: Funcheap SF
