BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Fort Mason Holiday Night Market: 90+ Food & Craft Vendors (Decembe
 r 2026)
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261218T170000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261218T220000
DTSTAMP:20261107T102259Z
UID:funcheap-1555200@sf-cal
SEQUENCE:0
CATEGORIES:Eating Drinking
DESCRIPTION:“Off the Grid” Fort Mason: Friday Night Market w/ 110+ Ven
 dors (2026)\nOff the Grid\nFort Mason Night Market returns for 2026 with f
 ood trucks\, craft vendors & live music on the waterfront.\nSan Francisco
 ’s popular waterfront night market is back for 2026. The Fort Mason Nigh
 t Market returns monthly from April through December\, bringing together l
 ocal food vendors\, craft makers\, live music\, and family-friendly activi
 ties at the historic waterfront campus of Fort Mason Center for Arts & Cul
 ture.\nHosted in partnership with Off the Grid\, West Coast Craft\, and St
 ern Grove Festival\, the free outdoor market transforms Fort Mason into a 
 lively evening destination for shopping\, dining\, and sunset views along 
 the bay.\nExpect a rotating lineup of food trucks and pop-ups\, dozens of 
 local artisans\, DJs and live performances\, plus hands-on workshops and p
 ublic art installations.\n\n🍴 What to Expect Each Month\n\n25+ Food Tru
 cks & Vendors curated by Off the Grid\n50+ Local Craft & Retail Vendors cu
 rated by West Coast Craft\nLive Music & DJs programmed by Stern Grove Fest
 ival\nCreative Workshops including all-ages art activities\nOutdoor Bars &
  Dining from Fort Mason resident restaurants\nWaterfront Views and plenty 
 of space to gather\n\n📅 2026 Fort Mason Night Market Schedule\nAll even
 ts run from 5:00 p.m. to 10:00 p.m.\n\nFriday\, April 17\, 2026\nFriday\, 
 May 22\, 2026\nFriday\, June 19\, 2026\nAdditional monthly dates continue 
 through December 2026 (TBA)\n\n🧭 Good to Know\n\nAdmission: Free\nFamil
 y-Friendly: Yes\, all...\n\nFree\n\nTickets: https://fortmason.org/event/f
 ort-mason-night-market-2026-2/2026-12-18/\nDetails: https://sf.funcheap.co
 m/off-the-grid-fort-mason-holidays-night-market-december/\nSource: Funchea
 p SF
IMAGE;VALUE=URI:https://cdn.funcheap.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/02/fortma
 sonOTG.jpg
LAST-MODIFIED:20261107T102259Z
LOCATION:Fort Mason Center\, 2 Marina Blvd\, San Francisco\, CA
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
URL:https://sf.funcheap.com/off-the-grid-fort-mason-holidays-night-market-
 december/
END:VEVENT
